//
// Two rules that catch people out:
//   1. NARRATIVE ONLY. PAPPG: "must not include any quantifiable financial
//      information." No dollar figures, no hours, no percentages of salary.
//   2. NSF EXPECTS THESE RESOURCES TO MATERIALIZE if the award is made. This
