//
// This section carries unusual weight for a small nonprofit, because it is
// where the things that are not on the budget get to count: volunteer
// maintainer capacity, community infrastructure, compute or lab access from a
// partner institution, an advisory relationship.
//
// Substantial unfunded collaborations described here must ALSO be documented
// by a letter of collaboration (PAPPG II.D.2.d(iv)). Keep this section and the
// letters consistent — a reviewer will cross-check.
// =============================================================================

